{"steam_appid":5133900,"steam_name":"Can 'Em All","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/5133900/19343683/d977710e53b502d5f757248d223f588df380c706/1793308250/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1793308712","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257443075/42e7fcb653b1559126024cf03614a7450c34e783/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793308712","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/b07090f5637de322d25dcdb457b51b21ed15a80b/ss_b07090f5637de322d25dcdb457b51b21ed15a80b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793384095","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/34846efbb99bedee7c905d728002482d908f2081/ss_34846efbb99bedee7c905d728002482d908f2081.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793384095","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/7b4d7c2dee36841671fe6c1af887a146792d8737/ss_7b4d7c2dee36841671fe6c1af887a146792d8737.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793384095","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/a581fbd84e0b116fe0793280a72d129148041b68/ss_a581fbd84e0b116fe0793280a72d129148041b68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793384095","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/36b0ef9914633778d62a8dc4c9aebf7e1472b823/ss_36b0ef9914633778d62a8dc4c9aebf7e1472b823.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793384095"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oh look, the truck is here.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truck delivers a fresh batch of adorable creatures straight to your factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately for them, they're also your main source of income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.poster.avif?t=1793384095\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.webm?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/aa1b96bb030f0bc501c76c55aae7d2e1.mp4?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First, you need them dead.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your weapons and clear out the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.poster.avif?t=1793384095\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.webm?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/50cdf60afc44135425221e5aade8b9c7.mp4?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now turn them into something useful.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the bodies  and throw them into the crusher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.poster.avif?t=1793384095\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.webm?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/989f9d0f2182340c739385317bc39658.mp4?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get those cans into the tube.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your freshly processed cans still need to be sold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.poster.avif?t=1793384095\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.webm?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/c8c0c3fc2fb18f48f640429b738e9957.mp4?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reinvest in the business.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger weapons. Upgrade your vacuum. Unlock machines. Build conveyors. Increase production. Bring in more creatures. Automate the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.poster.avif?t=1793384095\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.webm?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133900/extras/bf68f3947b94678e079c781f164c48bb.mp4?t=1793384095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 / Intel Core i3-7100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 460 / NVIDIA GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["LuisDev"],"publishers":["LuisDev"],"release_date":"30 Oct, 2026"}